    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39654" root="نزب" body-key="n">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَزَبَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَزِبَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَزِيبٌ</span> (S, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَزْبٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُزَابٌ</span> (K) <i>He</i> (an antelope) <i>uttered a cry,</i> or
<i>sound,</i> (S, K,) <i>at rutting-time.</i> (S.) Used with
reference to the buck and the doe; (K;) or the
buck only. (S, K.)

